<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακκύλιος</span></b>  (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκτυλος</span>), ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ring, signet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				884
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				359e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπὶ τοῦ δ.</span> keeper of
			the <i>signet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς πόλεως δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					229.88
				</span></i>
			 (Smyrna, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φαρμακίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				177
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything ringshaped,</i> as, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>felloe</i> of a wheel, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>anus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Demon.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				28.68
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> pl., <i>movable rings</i> on a bit, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				10.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>stone</i> to which mooring-cables were attached, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>door-handle,</i> Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>end of the steering-paddle,</i> Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
